通消息；私通；发生暧昧关系；关系亲密</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218421\">これは<ruby>古今東西<rp>(</rp><rt>ここんとうざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>つう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずる<ruby>真理<rp>(</rp><rt>しんり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This is a universal truth that transcends time.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通知</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">通知；通报；报告；公告；通知（智能手机、电脑等设备上的）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227632\">おって<ruby>通知<rp>(</rp><rt>つうち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があるまで<ruby>待<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Wait until further notice.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通帳</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうちょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">存折；银行存折</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通訳</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうやく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">口头翻译；口译；口译员；翻译员</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"100792\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>通訳<rp>(</rp><rt>つうやく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>として<ruby>雇<rp>(</rp><rt>やと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He engaged her as an interpreter.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通用</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（语言、货币等的）通用；流通；使用；（票证等）有效；被接受；行得通；成立；适用；有效；通过；进出；出入</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101366\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>年<rp>(</rp><rt>とし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>若<rp>(</rp><rt>わか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えるので、<ruby>大学生<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>として<ruby>通用<rp>(</rp><rt>つうよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He looks so young for his age that he passes for a college student.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通路</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">通道；过道；走廊；路径</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218942\">これが<ruby>海<rp>(</rp><rt>うみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>への<ruby>通路<rp>(</rp><rt>つうろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This is the passage to the sea.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">付き合う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つきあう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">交往；陪伴；与...来往；谈恋爱；跟随；迎合；配合；陪同</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">突き当たり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つきあたり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">街道、走廊等的尽头</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">突き当たる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つきあたる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">撞上；碰撞；冲撞；到达（街道）的尽头；遇到；碰到（困难、问题等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"182611\"><ruby>急<rp>(</rp><rt>いそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いだあまり<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はだれか<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>突<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>当<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">In my hurry I bumped into someone.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">月日</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つきひ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">时光；岁月；光阴；月亮与太阳；日月</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207387\">その<ruby>二<rp>(</rp><rt>ふた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つの<ruby>事件<rp>(</rp><rt>じけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>間<rp>(</rp><rt>あいだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>何年<rp>(</rp><rt>なんねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もの<ruby>月日<rp>(</rp><rt>つきひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>経<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Years intervene between the two incidents.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">点く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（灯、炉火等）点燃；着火；燃烧；（灯、电器等）亮起；打开；启动</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74072\"><ruby>木造建築物<rp>(</rp><rt>もくぞうけんちくぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>火<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がつきやすい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Wooden buildings catch fire easily.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">突く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">刺；戳；戳；刺；推；顶；捅；敲击；用（拐杖等）支撑；靠着（地板等）压；攻击；进攻；冒着（雨等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202423\">テーブルにひじを<ruby>突<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くのはやめなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Stop resting your elbows on the table.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">次ぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">跟随；接在…之后；排在…之后；仅次于</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225735\">きれい<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きは<ruby>敬神<rp>(</rp><rt>けいしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>次<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぐ<ruby>美徳<rp>(</rp><rt>びとく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Cleanliness is next to godliness.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">浸ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">浸泡；浸渍；蘸；浸入；腌制；腌渍；用盐或醋等腌渍</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113349\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はスプーンをスープの<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>につけた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He dipped his spoon into the soup.</span></div></li>"]